Reason: port: endianness: JAudio's direct disc loads (loadDVDFile, loadTmpDVDFile) convert what they read by name, as archive loads do; the retail game only reaches them when a disc carries its own /AudioRes/msound.aaf
--- a/src/JSystem/JAudio/JAInterface/JAIBasic.cpp
